# =========================================================================
# BUJJI PRICE-LEVELS REFRESH
#
# Rebuilds the dated structure map (levels + zones) from the COMPLETED bars
# in the normalized store, so a trading session reads a map instead of
# re-deriving one inside every five-minute decision cycle.
#
# WHY THIS UNIT EXISTS. scripts/refresh_price_levels.py describes itself as a
# "Daily price-levels refresh" that "RUNS AFTER THE CLOSE, on purpose" -- and
# nothing scheduled it. It had been run by hand exactly once, on 2026-08-19,
# and the map had aged silently ever since. Built, never wired.
#
# OBSERVATION ONLY, AND THAT IS LOAD-BEARING HERE. Nothing in the decision
# chain reads this map -- verified three ways: its only consumer is
# `level_context=` into build_thesis_artifact(); that artifact is write-only
# (built -> record_market_thesis() -> discarded); and the regime provider is
# constructed from the thesis and volatility regime without it.
# bujji/shadow_observatory/thesis_artifact.py states it at the field:
# "OBSERVATION ONLY -- nothing in the decision chain reads it."
#
# So a failure here is NOT a trading emergency. It costs an entry in the
# evidence trail whose purpose is to answer, at the operator gate, "would
# levels have helped?" -- a question that must be answered from a real trail
# rather than from argument. A silently ageing map answers it wrongly.
#
# NO CREDENTIALS. The script reads a local SQLite store and touches no broker
# (verified: zero FYERS references in it). Deliberately no EnvironmentFile and
# no network dependency -- this job cannot be taken down by a dead token, and
# must not be able to consume one.
#
# EXIT CODES, from the script's own docstring: 0 built (INCLUDING an honest
# INSUFFICIENT_HISTORY snapshot), 2 no usable bars at all, 3 unexpected
# failure. No SuccessExitStatus= is set, so only 0 is success and 2/3 fail the
# unit and reach OnFailure=. That is correct: "I could not build a map" is a
# fact an operator should be told, not one to absorb.
#
# Never enable this unit directly; enable the .timer.
# =========================================================================
[Unit]
Description=Bujji price-levels refresh — rebuild the structure map from completed bars

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=bujji
Group=bujji
WorkingDirectory=/opt/bujji/app
ExecStart=/opt/bujji/.venv/bin/python scripts/refresh_price_levels.py
